/Title (SentinelAI is an Enterprise AI Gateway that provides centralized management, governance, and intelligent optimization for AI-powered applications. Instead of allowing applications to communicate directly with LLMs, SentinelAI acts as an intermediary that authenticates users, manages organizations, enforces policies, monitors AI usage, and maintains audit logs.)
