608 0 obj
<<
/Title (SentinelAI acts as a centralized AI Gateway between enterprise applications and LLM providers. Every user request first passes through the Enterprise Memory Intelligence module. If a similar verified response already exists, the system returns the cached response without contacting the LLM. Otherwise, the request is forwarded to the selected LLM, and the generated response is validated, stored, and reused for future requests.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 561 0 R
/Next 609 0 R
>>
